ion -- ssh -> curl -> grep --\nblocked by the tool-name counter). Calibrated on production\nshapes: canonical iterators score high (tail -N vs tail -M: 1.0;\ngit-log paging: ~0.67); same-host different-command investigation\nis borderline (~0.5-0.7); tool-switching investigation ~0.07.\nOne-char tokens (the iterator's changing counter) are dropped\nbefore comparison: the counter is noise, the shape is the signal.\"\n  :type 'float\n  :safe #'iar--unit-float-or-nil-p\n  :group 'iar)\n[t+03:51/60:00 c36/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_jqeaoyny","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"wc -c /root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/DIGEST.md"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[19:50:44] 191 /root/personalization/audit/iar/continuo/DIGEST.md\n\n[t+04:03/60:00 c37/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_tl268830","function":{"index":0,"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"path":"/root/personalization/tasks"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[19:50:54] .gitkeep\niar/\nlibrarian/\n[t+04:13/60:00 c38/300]"}]
