nsus-updates.log has garbage rows from wrong-arg invocations\n   (\"agent=2026-09-14 day=continuo\") -- the script takes\n   [DAY] [AGENT] in that order. Wrong order = silent nonsense row.\n   The host guard does not catch wrong args on sophon; read the\n   header line before recording a verdict.\n3. failure-triage.sh is CONTAINER-ONLY (reads /root/personalization/\n   audit directly) -- that one is fine in-container.\n\n* CONTEXT\n\n13/13 pre-0914 thinking-loop fires were FIRST-REQUEST loops (no tool\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.\n[t+00:47/60:00 c6/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_6g72lmiz","function":{"index":0,"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"path":"/root/personalization/tasks/iar/continuo/failure-reduction"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[00:33:36] census-updates.log\ncensus-window-host-guard-note.org\ncensus-window.log\ndescription.org\n[t+01:06/60:00 c7/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_57h9v4zc","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_file","arguments":{"filepath":"/root/personalization/tasks/iar/continuo/failure-reduction/census-window.log"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[00:33:45] 2026-09-14: clean window (real data from sophon host, window 00:00-06:30 UTC, runs=16, timeouts=0, exit1=0)\n2026-09-15: exit1 without timeout (real data from sophon host, window 00:00-06:30 UTC, runs=12, timeouts=0, exit1=1)\n2026-09-16: clean window (real data from sophon host, window 00:00-06:30 UTC, runs=0, timeouts=0, exit1=0)\n\n== census-window: agent=continuo day=2026-09-16 window=00:00-06:30 UTC ==\n--- runs (start UTC | timeout? turns tools exit fate):\nno journald lines for continuo in window (clean or unit not logging)\n--- aggregate: runs=0 timeouts=0 exit1=0\n--- requests in wi